Bento: High-Performance Network Telemetry using eBPF (Choi et al., 2020)
Method: Uses eBPF for deep, microsecond-level network telemetry monitoring.
Dataset: Data center traces and synthetic traffic.
Advantages: Captures network health metrics without slowing traffic.
Limitations: Passive monitoring only; does not repair lost traffic.
Research Gap: Linking real-time packet loss telemetry to instant state recovery.
Possible Improvements: Uses eBPF packet loss telemetry to directly trigger Mamba state synthesis.
